message.card_expired:
Hello {name}, we tried to renew your {plan} plan but the card we have on file has expired, so the latest payment didn't go through. There's nothing to worry about - your service is still running for now. Whenever you have a moment, just update your card and we'll handle the rest in one click. Reply here anytime if you'd like a hand.

Warmly,
{business}

message.insufficient_funds:
Hello {name}, a quick heads-up: your most recent {plan} payment didn't clear, and it looks like a temporary funding hiccup rather than anything wrong with your card. Your account stays active, so there's nothing urgent to do. We'll automatically retry in a few days - and if it'd help, just reply and we can sort out timing or options together.

Thanks for being with us,
{business}

message.generic_decline:
Hello {name}, we weren't able to process your {plan} renewal - the payment was declined without a specific reason, which usually points to a temporary hold on the bank or provider's side. Your service is still on, so nothing changes for now. It often helps to give your bank or provider a quick check or try another payment method, and we'll retry shortly either way. Reach out anytime.

Best,
{business}

message.issuer_do_not_retry:
Hello {name}, your latest {plan} payment didn't go through, and it was refused in a way that retrying won't fix, so we won't try this payment method again. Your service is still running for now. When you have a moment, please add a different card or payment method and the payment will go through from there. If you'd rather sort it out with your bank or provider first, that works too. Reply here if anything is unclear.

Best,
{business}

